                        <summary>Do you offer used shipping container offices and homes?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes, we offer refurbished shipping containers that can be converted into offices, houses, shops, or storage units. These are affordable, eco-friendly, and easily transportable &mdash; ideal for temporary or permanent use.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>Can container offices be stacked?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes. ISO containers are naturally stackable up to three levels high without additional external framework, making them ideal for multi-level site offices and compact compounds.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>What sizes of containers do you convert?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">We convert 20ft (6.06M) and 40ft (12.19M) ISO containers, including High-Cube units. Every conversion is built to order, so layouts, partitions, doors, windows and fit-outs are customized to your requirements.</div>
                    </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" data-aos="fade-up">
                        <summary>Do you deliver and install across Qatar?</summary>
                        <div class="faq-answer">Yes. We deliver fully fitted container units direct to your project site and our specialised crew handles on-site installation &mdash; across Doha, Lusail, Al Wakrah, Al Rayyan, Mesaieed, Al Khor, Ras Laffan and beyond. See our <a href="/portable-cabin-fabrication">fabrication page</a> for the full process.</div>
                    </details>
                </div>
